  "goodToKnow": "Die Hornhaut has two meanings: hard skin or callus (Hornhaut an den Füßen, removed with a Hornhautraspel) and the cornea of the eye. Laser eye surgery reshapes the Hornhaut. Other parts of the eye: die Netzhaut (retina), die Linse, die Iris. Figuratively, sich eine Hornhaut zulegen means to grow a thick skin. Plural: die Hornhäute."
